 }
 
-/// The `arms` attribute of [`match_`]: each arm's kind and its value, an
-/// integer attribute of the narrowest signless type holding it (none for
+/// The `arms` attribute of [`match_`]: each arm's kind and its value, the
+/// text of an integer attribute of the narrowest signless type holding it,
+/// in hexadecimal, which MLIR parses in linear time (none for
 /// [`ArmKind::Default`]).
